<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>בוטיק הצבע | שירותי CNC וצבע לנגרים</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;500;700;800&family=Noto+Serif+Hebrew:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      --black:   #0d0d0d;
      --dark:    #1a1a1a;
      --steel:   #2c2c2c;
      --mid:     #3d3d3d;
      --muted:   #888;
      --light:   #c8c8c8;
      --off:     #f2ede6;
      --cream:   #faf7f2;
      --white:   #ffffff;
      --gold:    #c8a96e;
      --gold2:   #a8893e;
      --accent:  #e8b84b;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 200;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.2rem 4rem;
      background: rgba(13,13,13,0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.15);
      animation: slideDown 0.7s ease both;
    }
    .logo {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1;
    }
    .logo-main {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--white); letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .logo-sub {
      font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted);
      transition: color 0.25s; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--black);
      border: none; cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.8rem;
      font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Left panel — dark with text */
    .hero-left {
      background: var(--black);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
      padding: 10rem 4rem 6rem;
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      animation: fadeUp 1s ease 0.2s both;
    }
    /* Diagonal cut */
    .hero-left::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: -80px;
      background: var(--black);
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 80px) 100%, 0 100%);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 30px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }
    .hero h1 .accent { color: var(--gold); }

    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--muted); max-width: 420px;
      margin-bottom: 3rem; font-weight: 300;
    }

    .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-gold {
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--black);
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-gold:hover { background: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-ghost {
      border: 1px solid var(--steel); color: var(--light);
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }

    /* Right panel — CNC image feel with CSS */
    .hero-right {
      background: var(--steel);
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease 0.4s both;
    }
    .hero-right-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          transparent, transparent 59px,
          rgba(200,169,110,0.04) 59px, rgba(200,169,110,0.04) 60px
        ),
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          0deg,
          transparent, transparent 59px,
          rgba(200,169,110,0.04) 59px, rgba(200,169,110,0.04) 60px
        ),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #2c2c2c 50%, #1a1a1a 100%);
    }
    /* Large CNC icon */
    .cnc-visual {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .cnc-letters {
      font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 14rem);
      font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px rgba(200,169,110,0.3);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .cnc-line {
      width: 60%; height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    }
    .cnc-sub {
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.5em;
      color: rgba(200,169,110,0.5); text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Stat badges */
    .hero-stats {
      position: absolute; bottom: 3rem; right: 2.5rem;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;
      z-index: 5;
      animation: fadeUp 1s ease 0.8s both;
    }
    .stat-badge {
      background: rgba(13,13,13,0.85);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 1rem 1.4rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--gold);
      display: block; line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-lbl { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

    /* ── MARQUEE ── */
    .marquee-bar {
      background: var(--gold); padding: 0.7rem 0;
      overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .marquee-inner {
      display: inline-block;
      animation: marquee 16s linear infinite;
      font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--black);
    }
    .marquee-inner span { margin: 0 2.5rem; opacity: 0.5; }

    /* ── SERVICES ── */
    .services {
      padding: 8rem 4rem;
      background: var(--dark);
    }
    .sec-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.42em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .sec-eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 22px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); }
    .sec-title {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2;
      color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }
    .sec-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }

    /* Big numbered service cards */
    .svc-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
      gap: 1px; background: var(--steel);
    }
    .svc-card {
      background: var(--dark);
      padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      transition: background 0.4s;
    }
    .svc-card:hover { background: var(--steel); }
    .svc-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 2px; background: var(--gold);
      transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: right;
      transition: transform 0.4s;
    }
    .svc-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); transform-origin: left; }

    .svc-bg-num {
      position: absolute; top: -1.5rem; left: 1.5rem;
      font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 8rem; font-weight: 800;
      color: rgba(200,169,110,0.05); line-height: 1;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .svc-icon { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block; }
    .svc-name {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .svc-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; }
    .svc-tags {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .tag {
      background: rgba(200,169,110,0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.2);
      color: var(--gold); padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    /* ── CATALOG STRIP ── */
    .catalog {
      padding: 7rem 4rem;
      background: var(--black);
    }
    .catalog-layout {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .catalog-text {}
    .catalog-title {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2;
      color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .catalog-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .catalog-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 2rem; }

    /* Door type showcase */
    .door-types {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 1rem;
    }
    .door-type {
      background: var(--steel);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.15);
      padding: 1.8rem 1.2rem;
      text-align: center;
      transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    }
    .door-type:hover { border-color: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .door-svg {
      width: 56px; height: 70px;
      margin: 0 auto 1rem;
      border: 2px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.5);
      position: relative;
    }
    .door-svg::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 6px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.3);
    }
    .door-type-name {
      font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--light); text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .door-count {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gold);
      display: block; margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    /* ── PROCESS ── */
    .process {
      padding: 7rem 4rem;
      background: var(--dark);
    }
    .process-steps {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);
      gap: 0; margin-top: 5rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .process-steps::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 2rem; right: 12.5%; left: 12.5%;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    }
    .p-step { text-align: center; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .p-dot {
      width: 4rem; height: 4rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.4);
      background: var(--dark);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 1.8rem;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gold);
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .p-step:hover .p-dot { background: var(--gold); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--gold); }
    .p-step h4 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .p-step p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; }

    /* ── STATS BAR ── */
    .stats-bar {
      background: var(--gold);
      padding: 4rem;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);
      gap: 2rem; text-align: center;
    }
    .stat-item-num {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 3.2rem; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--black); display: block; line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-item-lbl {
      font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0.4rem;
      display: block;
    }

    /* ── CTA ── */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 8rem 4rem;
      background: var(--black);
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cta-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 800px; height: 400px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(200,169,110,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
    }
    .cta-inner {
      max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center; position: relative;
    }
    .cta-inner .sec-eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
    .cta-title {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--white); margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .cta-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .cta-desc { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 3rem; }

    .cta-contact {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;
    }
    .phone-big {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
      color: var(--white); text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .phone-big:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .phone-label { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .cta-name { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.5rem; }

    .cta-btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--dark);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.1);
      padding: 2rem 4rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--mid);
    }
    .footer-logo-txt {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Hebrew', serif;
      font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
    .footer-links a { color: var(--mid); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

    /* ── REVEAL ── */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity 0.75s ease, transform 0.75s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    .d1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
    .d2 { transition-delay: 0.22s; }
    .d3 { transition-delay: 0.34s; }

    /* ── KEYFRAMES ── */
    @keyframes slideDown {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-14px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(36px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }
    @keyframes marquee {
      from { transform: translateX(0); }
      to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; }
      .hero-left { padding: 7rem 1.8rem 3rem; }
      .hero-left::after { display: none; }
      .hero-right { height: 55vw; }
      .services, .catalog, .process, .cta-section { padding: 4rem 1.8rem; }
      .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .catalog-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
      .door-types { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
      .process-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
      .process-steps::before { display: none; }
      .stats-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); padding: 3rem 1.8rem; }
      .hero-stats { display: none; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1.8rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="logo-main">בוטיק הצבע</span>
      <span class="logo-sub">שירותי CNC וצבע לנגרים</span>
    </div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#services">שירותים</a></li>
      <li><a href="#catalog">קטלוג</a></li>
      <li><a href="#process">תהליך</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">צור קשר</a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="nav-cta" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">קבל הצעת מחיר</button>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-left">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">שירותי CNC וצבע לנגרים</div>
      <h1>
        דיוק. <span class="accent">מקצועיות.</span><br/>
        תוצאה שמדברת<br/>
        בעד עצמה.
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        בוטיק הצבע מספק שירותי חריטה CNC מתקדמת וצביעה מקצועית לנגרים, קבלנים ומעצבים. עבודה מדויקת, חומרים איכותיים, זמני אספקה קצרים.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a class="btn-gold" href="tel:+972525904400">📞 התקשר לרמי</a>
        <a class="btn-ghost" href="#services">הכירו את השירותים</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right">
      <div class="hero-right-bg"></div>
      <div class="cnc-visual">
        <div class="cnc-letters">CNC</div>
        <div class="cnc-line"></div>
        <div class="cnc-sub">Computer Numerical Control</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat-badge">
          <span class="stat-num">100+</span>
          <span class="stat-lbl">דגמי חריטה</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-badge">
          <span class="stat-num">24/48</span>
          <span class="stat-lbl">שעות אספקה</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARQUEE -->
  <div class="marquee-bar">
    <div class="marquee-inner">
      חריטת CNC <span>✦</span> צביעת MDF <span>✦</span> דגמי חריטה <span>✦</span> מסגרות <span>✦</span> מילואה <span>✦</span> אנגליים <span>✦</span> יוקרה <span>✦</span> פרופיל בולט <span>✦</span>
      חריטת CNC <span>✦</span> צביעת MDF <span>✦</span> דגמי חריטה <span>✦</span> מסגרות <span>✦</span> מילואה <span>✦</span> אנגליים <span>✦</span> יוקרה <span>✦</span> פרופיל בולט <span>✦</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section class="services" id="services">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-eyebrow">מה אנחנו מציעים</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">שירותים <em>מקצועיים</em><br/>לכל פרויקט נגרות</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <div class="svc-card reveal">
        <span class="svc-bg-num">01</span>
        <span class="svc-icon">⚙️</span>
        <h3 class="svc-name">חריטת CNC</h3>
        <p class="svc-desc">חריטה ממוחשבת בדיוק גבוה על MDF ועץ. מאות דגמים מוכנים — חריטה, מסגרות, מילואה, אנגליים ועוד — לפי מידה ודרישה.</p>
        <div class="svc-tags">
          <span class="tag">דיוק מלא</span>
          <span class="tag">כל עובי</span>
          <span class="tag">לפי מידה</span>
        </div>
      </div>
